IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-23`

-- Tests of Article 23. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- Fixtures: `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` is an Annex III system placed 2 December 2027, `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` one placed 2 December 2028; Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- Art 23(5), positional: there is a certificate issued by the notified body; a copy of the certificate; a copy of the instructions for use; a copy of the EU declaration of conformity.
`P3 copies all kept` MEANS `Art 23(5) what the importer keeps` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 copies no certificate exists` MEANS `Art 23(5) what the importer keeps` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 copies certificate not kept` MEANS `Art 23(5) what the importer keeps` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 copies without instructions` MEANS `Art 23(5) what the importer keeps` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 copies without declaration` MEANS `Art 23(5) what the importer keeps` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE


§ `Art 23(1): the importer verifies points (a) to (d)`

-- args: verified that the conformity assessment procedure (Article 43) was carried out; that the technical documentation was drawn up (Article 11, Annex IV); that the CE marking, the EU declaration of conformity (Article 47) and the instructions for use are there; that the authorised representative was appointed (Article 22(1))
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(1) the importer has verified, before placing the system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 23(2): the bar while the importer has sufficient reason to consider the system non-conforming, falsified or accompanied by falsified documentation`

-- args: sufficient reason to consider it not in conformity; falsified; accompanied by falsified documentation; brought into conformity
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Until it has been brought into conformity: after that the bar is off (ruling (d)).
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No sufficient reason: the "Where" condition fails; the bar is off (periods ruling, rule (b); fork F-when-upon).
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer is barred from placing the high-risk AI system on the market` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- args: the risk within the meaning of Article 79(1); informed the provider; informed the authorised representative; informed the market surveillance authorities
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(2) the importer has informed the provider, the authorised representative and the market surveillance authorities of the risk` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 23(3): the importer's name and address`

-- args: the name, registered trade name or registered trade mark is indicated; the address is indicated; the indications appear at each place where applicable
#ASSERT `Art 23(3) the importer has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark, and its address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(3) the importer has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark, and its address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(3) the importer has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark, and its address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(3) the importer has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark, and its address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(3) the importer has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark, and its address` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 23(4): storage or transport conditions, while the system is under the importer's responsibility`

-- args: under the importer's responsibility; there are storage or transport conditions; the conditions do not jeopardise compliance with Section 2
#ASSERT `Art 23(4) the importer has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(4) the importer has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(4) the importer has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(4) the importer has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(4) the importer has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 23(5): copies kept for 10 years`

#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the last day of the period for keeping the copies` `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` EQUALS Date 2 12 2037
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies all kept` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Where applicable: with no certificate issued by a notified body none is needed.
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies no certificate exists` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies certificate not kept` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies without instructions` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies without declaration` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies all kept` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- After the last day (fork F-18-1): JUST FALSE (the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, rule (a)). Before the placement: NOTHING.
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 3 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies without instructions` EQUALS NOTHING; the period is one the text fixes in its own words ("for a period of 10 years after"), so outside it the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, rule (a) (ENCODING-GUIDE.md line 93: "outside the period the answer is `JUST FALSE`"), gives JUST FALSE; before the placement the answer stays NOTHING (the text gives the period no start)
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 3 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies without instructions` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 copies all kept` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 23(5) the importer keeps the copies for the period` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 copies all kept` EQUALS NOTHING

