§ `Traces`

-- Art 23(1): verify before placing. Placed 2 December 2028, asked 2 December 2027: 366 days left, inclusive.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 23(1) the importer's duty to verify the matters in points (a) to (d) before placing the system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(1) verify, before placing the high-risk AI system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` AT 366
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 23(1) the importer's duty to verify the matters in points (a) to (d) before placing the system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(1) verify, before placing the high-risk AI system on the market, the matters in points (a) to (d)` AT 367
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 23(1) the importer's duty to verify the matters in points (a) to (d) before placing the system on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 23(1) the importer's duty to verify the matters in points (a) to (d) before placing the system on the market` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 23(2): the bar runs from the date asked until the day before the system is brought into conformity (here 12 December 2027, day 10): placing on day 9 breaches, on day 10 does not.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 23(2) the importer's duty not to place the system on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE (JUST (Date 12 12 2027)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(2) place the high-risk AI system on the market` AT 9
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 23(2) the importer's duty not to place the system on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE (JUST (Date 12 12 2027)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(2) place the high-risk AI system on the market` AT 10
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 23(2) the importer's duty not to place the system on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE (JUST (Date 2 12 2027)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(2) place the high-risk AI system on the market` AT 3
-- No date for the conformity: the bar has no end.
