    PARTY Importer DOES `Art 23(2) place the high-risk AI system on the market` AT 500
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 23(2) the importer's duty not to place the system on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
